{"id":"wb-7-1669","name":"沈阳中山广场建筑群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"沈阳中山广场建筑群","text":"沈阳中山广场建筑群位于中国辽宁省沈阳市和平区，包括中山广场和周边的六大建筑，2007年成为第七批辽宁省文物保护单位，2013年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n沈阳中山广场的前身叫中央广场，始建于1913年，1919年改名“浪速广场”，抗战胜利后改名为中山广场。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B2%88%E9%98%B3%E4%B8%AD%E5%B1%B1%E5%B9%BF%E5%9C%BA%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":84934256,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84934256","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b62e8422cc5e4701c5d6ab68.jpg","title":"Mukden_Naniwa_Square_2.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mukden_Naniwa_Square_2.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/56/Mukden_Naniwa_Square_2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"old photo","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"Mukden Naniwa Square","width":320,"height":187}}